            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Drivers who qualify for a new bus are expected to accept the assignment; however, a medical excuse from a Board of Education-approved physician may be considered. If a new bus is offered to an eligible bus operator and the employee turns down the assignment, the employee's ranking will be maintained. However, the employee will not be considered for a new bus assignment until his/her cycle comes up again (would probably have to wait a minimum of five years).",
            "block_bbox": [
