        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. This procedure shall be effective beginning July 1, 1990. Employees assigned a new bus within the last three fiscal years will be exempt from an assignment effective July 1, 1990. They will be assigned a ranking and will be eligible when the cycle reaches their number.",
